      "KATE: Chloe, do angels have wings?\nCHLOE: Sometimes?\nKATE: Always! They all have wings! That’s the difference between an angel and a person, wings!",
      "KATE: No but!\nCHLOE: It’s a very pretty angel.",
      "KATE: For the last damn time, angels have wings! Wings!\nKATE: And now you’re disappearing. That’s not good. I’m sorry, you were saying something? Important information? Hello?\nKATE: Shit.\nASHLEY: It’s coming in clearer now... definitely coming in...",
      "ASHLEY: I’m back!\nMARY: I’ve got to run-\nASHLEY: I’m so sorry-\nMARY: No, you did good.",
      "ASHLEY: So let’s give it a shot.\nCHLOE: Should I stay or...?\nASHLEY: It’s probably better if we’re alone.\nCHLOE: Okay."
    ]
